### Description

A filtered `ThenLoad` on a nested collection throws `LinqToDBException: Invalid filter function usage.` from `LoadWithBuilder.CheckFilterFunc` when:

1. the query source is a `SelectMany`/`join` that projects the root entity (`from o in Orgs from a in OrgSys.Where(...) join s in Sys on ... select s`), and
2. the root entity has an association with the same name as the one the `ThenLoad` targets (`Sys.Organisations` and `Product.Organisations`, with different element types).

| Case | 5.4.1.9 | 6.5.0 | 6.5.1 |
|---|---|---|---|
| `GetTable<Sys>()` source, filtered ThenLoad | pass | pass | pass |
| SelectMany source, filtered ThenLoad, member name clash | pass | throws | throws |
| SelectMany source, filtered ThenLoad, root member renamed | pass | pass | pass |
| SelectMany source, unfiltered ThenLoad | pass | pass | pass |

On 6.x, `IQueryable.ToString()` no longer builds the query, so the repro calls `ToSqlQuery()` to force it.

### Workaround in place

Workaround that worked for us: keep the root entity as the query root and move the SelectMany/join into a semi-join filter, so the eager-load chain hangs off `GetTable<Sys>()` directly.

Before (throws on 6.x):

```cs
var query =
    from o in db.GetTable<Org>().Where(x => x.Id == 5)
    from a in db.GetTable<OrgSys>().Where(x => x.OrganisationId == o.Id)
    join s in db.GetTable<Sys>() on a.SystemId equals s.Id
    select s;
```

After (works on 6.5.0 / 6.5.1):

```cs
var systemIds =
    from o in db.GetTable<Org>().Where(x => x.Id == 5)
    from a in db.GetTable<OrgSys>().Where(x => x.OrganisationId == o.Id)
    select a.SystemId;

var query = db.GetTable<Sys>().Where(x => systemIds.Contains(x.Id));

query
    .LoadWith(x => x.Stages)
        .ThenLoad(x => x.Product)
            .ThenLoad(x => x.Organisations, x => x.Where(y => orgIds.Contains(y.OrganisationId)));
```

It's still one query (`WHERE [Id] IN (SELECT ...)`). One side effect: a system linked twice no longer comes back twice, which suited us.

### Reproduction Steps
No database is needed: the exception is thrown while the query is being built.

`Repro.csproj`:

```xml
<Project Sdk="Microsoft.NET.Sdk">
  <PropertyGroup>
    <OutputType>Exe</OutputType>
    <TargetFramework>net9.0</TargetFramework>
  </PropertyGroup>
  <ItemGroup>
    <PackageReference Include="linq2db" Version="6.5.1" />
    <PackageReference Include="Microsoft.Data.SqlClient" Version="6.0.2" />
  </ItemGroup>
</Project>
```

`Program.cs`:

```cs
using System;
using System.Collections.Generic;
using System.Linq;
using System.Linq.Expressions;
using LinqToDB;
using LinqToDB.Data;
using LinqToDB.DataProvider.SqlServer;
using LinqToDB.Mapping;

var options = new DataOptions().UseSqlServer("Server=.;Database=x;", SqlServerVersion.v2019, SqlServerProvider.MicrosoftDataSqlClient);
using var db = new DataConnection(options);
var orgIds = new List<int> { 1, 2 };

var query =
    from o in db.GetTable<Org>().Where(x => x.Id == 5)
    from a in db.GetTable<OrgSys>().Where(x => x.OrganisationId == o.Id)
    join s in db.GetTable<Sys>() on a.SystemId equals s.Id
    select s;

// Throws on 6.5.0 / 6.5.1.
var sql = query
    .LoadWith(x => x.Stages)
        .ThenLoad(x => x.Product)
            .ThenLoad(x => x.Organisations, x => x.Where(y => orgIds.Contains(y.OrganisationId)))
    .ToSqlQuery();

Console.WriteLine(sql.Sql);

[Table] public class Org { [PrimaryKey] public int Id { get; set; } }
[Table] public class OrgSys { [PrimaryKey] public int Id { get; set; } [Column] public int SystemId { get; set; } [Column] public int OrganisationId { get; set; } }
[Table] public class ProdOrg { [PrimaryKey] public int Id { get; set; } [Column] public int ProductId { get; set; } [Column] public int OrganisationId { get; set; } }
[Table] public class Product
{
    [PrimaryKey] public int Id { get; set; }
    [Association(ThisKey = nameof(Id), OtherKey = nameof(ProdOrg.ProductId))] public IEnumerable<ProdOrg> Organisations { get; set; }
}
[Table] public class Stage
{
    [PrimaryKey] public int Id { get; set; } [Column] public int SystemId { get; set; } [Column] public int ProductId { get; set; }
    [Association(ThisKey = nameof(ProductId), OtherKey = nameof(Product.Id))] public Product Product { get; set; }
}
[Table] public class Sys
{
    [PrimaryKey] public int Id { get; set; }
    [Association(QueryExpressionMethod = nameof(GetOrgs), CanBeNull = true)] public IEnumerable<Org> Organisations { get; set; }
    [Association(ThisKey = nameof(Id), OtherKey = nameof(Stage.SystemId))] public IEnumerable<Stage> Stages { get; set; }
    public static Expression<Func<Sys, IDataContext, IQueryable<Org>>> GetOrgs() =>
        (s, db) => from a in db.GetTable<OrgSys>().Where(x => x.SystemId == s.Id) join o in db.GetTable<Org>() on a.OrganisationId equals o.Id select o;
}
```

It does not throw on 6.x if the source is `db.GetTable<Sys>()` instead of the SelectMany/join, if `Sys.Organisations` is renamed, or if the `ThenLoad` has no filter.

